## What's NOT here

Things one might expect but live elsewhere. Saves new agents from grep-ing
for files that don't exist in this repo.

- <e.g., "auth service — separate repo at github.com/<org>/auth">
- <e.g., "shared design tokens — npm package @<org>/tokens">

## Maintenance

Re-read this file every 3-6 months. Stale maps are worse than no map — an
agent that trusts an outdated row wastes time chasing a folder that
moved. Pair with the `claude-md` review cadence.
